@note The .zcmr is loaded AS a Custom View so that its saved display state (.cds) is applied exactly as it
would be for a view already in the project - rendering a view from its .zcmr therefore matches
rendering the same view by index or name. The temporary view is removed before returning, leaving the
project's Custom View list unchanged.
"""

